@page {
    route: "/about/",
    meta: {
        title: "About",
        description: "A neighboring static page with no island service",
    },
}

# About

This page is static CDN HTML. It has no Rocci components, no Datastar.js, and
no `connect-src` to the island service.

The [counter](/) on the home page is a `live` island: the CDN file is a
snapshot, and increment/reset POST to `rocdown serve-islands`.
